{"summary":"a cozy game about green energy","description":"Can you power a tiny town.. sustainably?\nEco Power Towns is a thoughtful strategy puzzle where every placement matters. Generate clean energy using solar, wind, tidal and biomass technologies; all while managing your limited resources. Upgrade, research, and optimize your layout to reach the energy goal and light up all the cozy homes.\n\nWhat to expect?\n- Contains no text at all: the entire game is icon-driven and intuitive.\n- Build solar panels, windmills, biomass plants, tidal generators and more.\n- Hints are available in case you get stuck on a level.\n- Reach energy goals before you run out of resources\n- Light up cozy houses across forests, swamps, hills, and rocky terrain\n- Unlock research upgrades to improve your production efficiency\n- Explore handcrafted levels of increasing challenge\n- Solve satisfying puzzles that reward careful planning\n- Enjoy peaceful lo-fi beat vibes and a clean, minimalist art style\n- A paid game: no ads, no tracking, no distractions, no data collected\n- Haptic Feedback\n\nI'm a solo game developer who made this game with a lot of care and love. I hope Eco Power Towns brings you a little joy, a little challenge, and a lot of cozy energy.","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ixshj16BwsM?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Dm26slrC2O9a8VXGoQT558gfns-mxBsJfHtipMY8vjhhojrq9yxAGxsl5RSarKQNISjlhRPFZ3hXUfmGKufG","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4pyc4klX6BoazXTpoft4pjgQcoiuJhcHwN9aIDj5FKWbUL3DTKERubaPUHNhQ2Kz3bL-BmSOoF20fW-hF3f8ng","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/6bC5WNaGlWtj8yPY4IyjSUrcQHSgm4Lza55qK9R10vLNW2oV2EX0NGqqp8iSS_fVeJN_YwpYoTfMdMJ2cFq0","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fwQ4j7VWNoHPLPXrss18DDtuKeWx27BvQgAxXuboRbtiPKXsmHzF_RR_RIohAF3QNwY_yQF7PL0JZ0Kzx-z7","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wGFEDwH8OLcd_05fdy5xJaOG_FH5eZXmP6